package api

// sswCurriculumAccommodationEnglish contains reviewed exact-source translations
// for accommodation-sector learning materials.
var sswCurriculumAccommodationEnglish = map[examSSWEnglishKey]string{
	{field: "ssw.description", source: `Melaksanakan alur layanan depan, menjaga identitas tamu, dan meneruskan permintaan yang perlu persetujuan petugas.`}: `Follow front-desk procedures, protect guest identities, and refer requests that require staff approval.`,
	{field: "ssw.title", source: `Menyambut tamu dan memeriksa reservasi`}:                                                                                   `Welcoming Guests and Checking Reservations`,
	{field: "ssw.objective", source: `Menyapa tamu serta mencocokkan nama, tanggal, jumlah tamu, dan nomor konfirmasi.`}:                                     `Greet guests and match the name, dates, party size, and confirmation number.`,
	{field: "ssw.objective", source: `Menggunakan ungkapan Jepang sederhana yang terkait dengan pekerjaan.`}:                                                 `Use simple Japanese expressions related to the job.`,
	{field: "ssw.title", source: `Konsep dan standar kerja`}:                                                                                                 `Work Concepts and Standards`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Layanan resepsionis dimulai dengan sapaan, pencarian reservasi, dan konfirmasi jumlah tamu serta lama menginap. Gunakan sistem dan aturan properti. Jika nama atau tanggal tidak cocok, periksa ejaan dan nomor konfirmasi dengan tenang. Jangan menyebutkan data tamu lain atau mengubah reservasi tanpa akses.`}: `Front-desk service begins with a greeting, locating the reservation, and confirming the number of guests and length of stay. Use the property's systems and procedures. If the name or dates do not match, calmly check the spelling and confirmation number. Do not disclose another guest's information or change a reservation without authorization.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Ulangi informasi penting dan minta tamu mengonfirmasi. Bila reservasi tidak ditemukan, jangan menyalahkan tamu atau menjanjikan kamar. Hubungi petugas senior, periksa sistem alternatif yang disetujui, dan berikan tempat menunggu yang sesuai.`}:                                                                `Repeat important information and ask the guest to confirm it. If you cannot find the reservation, do not blame the guest or promise a room. Contact a senior staff member, check an approved alternative system, and offer an appropriate place to wait.`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Sapa tamu dan tanyakan nama reservasi`}:                                                                                        `Greet the guest and ask for the reservation name`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Cocokkan tanggal, jumlah tamu, dan nomor konfirmasi`}:                                                                          `Match the dates, party size, and confirmation number`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Jelaskan hasil pemeriksaan dengan sopan`}:                                                                                      `Politely explain the result of the check`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Eskalasi ketidakcocokan sebelum mengubah data`}:                                                                                `Escalate any discrepancy before changing the record`,
	{field: "ssw.caution", source: `Jangan membacakan nama atau detail reservasi orang lain di area umum.`}:                                                     `Do not read another guest's name or reservation details aloud in a public area.`,
	{field: "ssw.scenario", source: `Tamu menunjukkan konfirmasi reservasi tetapi namanya tidak muncul pada layar resepsionis.`}:                                `A guest shows a reservation confirmation, but their name does not appear on the front-desk screen.`,
	{field: "ssw.response", source: `Periksa ejaan dan tanggal bersama tamu, jangan menjanjikan kamar, lalu minta petugas senior menelusuri sistem reservasi.`}: `Check the spelling and dates with the guest, do not promise a room, and ask a senior staff member to search the reservation system.`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `tanggal menginap`}:                                                                                                          `stay dates`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `konfirmasi`}:                                                                                                                `confirmation`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `penerimaan/resepsionis`}:                                                                                                    `reception/front desk`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Mohon nama pada reservasi.`}:                                                                                                `May I have the name on the reservation?`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Mohon tunggu sebentar, saya akan memeriksanya.`}:                                                                            `Please wait a moment while I check.`,
	{field: "ssw.title", source: `Check-in, identitas, dan privasi`}:                                                                                            `Check-In, Identification, and Privacy`,
	{field: "ssw.objective", source: `Memverifikasi data tamu dan memberikan kunci melalui prosedur yang menjaga kerahasiaan.`}:                                 `Verify guest information and issue keys using procedures that protect confidentiality.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Saat check-in, ikuti aturan properti untuk informasi identitas dan data menginap. Pastikan orang yang menerima kunci berhak atas kamar. Jangan menyebut nomor kamar keras-keras atau memperlihatkan data pada layar. Dokumen dan data tamu hanya digunakan untuk tujuan kerja yang diizinkan.`}:           `At check-in, follow the property's rules for identity and stay information. Make sure the person receiving a key is authorized for the room. Do not say room numbers aloud or expose information on a screen. Use guest documents and data only for authorized work purposes.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Minta dokumen dengan sopan, cocokkan nama dengan reservasi, jelaskan formulir, dan pastikan kunci diberikan kepada orang yang benar. Jika identitas, jumlah tamu, atau status pembayaran tidak cocok, jangan berikan kunci; minta petugas senior membantu dan simpan dokumen di tempat yang ditentukan.`}: `Politely ask for identification, match the name to the reservation, explain the form, and make sure the key goes to the right person. If the identity, party size, or payment status does not match, do not issue the key; ask a senior staff member for help and store documents in the designated place.`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Verifikasi reservasi dan identitas sesuai prosedur`}:                                                              `Verify the reservation and identity according to procedure`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Jelaskan formulir atau data yang perlu dikonfirmasi`}:                                                             `Explain the form or information that needs confirmation`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Pastikan penerima kunci berhak atas kamar`}:                                                                       `Confirm that the person receiving the key is authorized for the room`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Simpan data dan serahkan masalah kepada senior`}:                                                                  `Store the information securely and refer issues to a senior staff member`,
	{field: "ssw.caution", source: `Jangan memperlihatkan layar, dokumen, atau nomor kamar kepada orang yang tidak berhak.`}:                       `Do not show screens, documents, or room numbers to unauthorized people.`,
	{field: "ssw.scenario", source: `Seseorang meminta kunci kamar atas nama temannya, tetapi namanya tidak tercantum dalam reservasi.`}:           `Someone asks for a room key on behalf of a friend, but their name is not listed on the reservation.`,
	{field: "ssw.response", source: `Jangan berikan kunci atau nomor kamar. Hubungi tamu terdaftar atau petugas senior untuk memverifikasi izin.`}: `Do not give out the key or room number. Contact the registered guest or a senior staff member to verify authorization.`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `verifikasi identitas`}:                                                                                         `identity verification`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `kunci`}:                                                                                                        `key`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `informasi pribadi`}:                                                                                            `personal information`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `tamu yang menginap`}:                                                                                           `registered guest`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Saya akan memverifikasi identitas Anda.`}:                                                                      `I will verify your identity.`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Saya belum dapat memberikan kunci sebelum verifikasi selesai.`}:                                                `I cannot issue the key until verification is complete.`,
	{field: "ssw.title", source: `Perubahan jadwal dan status kamar`}:                                                                              `Schedule Changes and Room Status`,
	{field: "ssw.objective", source: `Menangani permintaan perpanjangan atau pindah kamar tanpa memperbarui sistem secara sepihak.`}:               `Handle requests to extend a stay or change rooms without updating the system on your own.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Reservasi, kebersihan, pembayaran, dan ketersediaan harus sesuai sebelum perubahan. Perpanjangan atau pindah kamar dapat memengaruhi tarif, pembersihan, serta tamu berikutnya. Petugas mencatat permintaan dan memeriksa aturan properti; hanya orang berwenang mengesahkan perubahan tertentu.`}: `Before making a change, confirm the reservation, room cleanliness, payment, and availability. An extension or room change may affect rates, cleaning, and the next guest. Staff record the request and check property rules; only authorized staff may approve certain changes.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Ulangi permintaan dan catat waktu serta kamar terkait. Periksa sistem, lalu jelaskan bahwa perubahan menunggu konfirmasi jika belum disetujui. Jangan memindahkan barang atau memberi kunci kamar lain sebelum status kamar, kebersihan, pembayaran, dan izin dipastikan.`}:                        `Repeat the request and record the time and room involved. Check the system, then explain that the change is pending confirmation if it has not been approved. Do not move belongings or issue another room key until room status, cleanliness, payment, and authorization are confirmed.`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Ulangi permintaan beserta tanggal atau kamar`}:                                                                                   `Repeat the request, including the dates or room`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Periksa ketersediaan dan aturan pada sistem`}:                                                                                    `Check availability and rules in the system`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Minta persetujuan petugas berwenang bila perlu`}:                                                                                 `Request approval from an authorized staff member if needed`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Perbarui catatan dan beri tahu bagian terkait`}:                                                                                  `Update the record and notify the relevant department`,
	{field: "ssw.caution", source: `Jangan menjanjikan kamar atau mengubah tanggal sebelum sistem dan petugas mengonfirmasi.`}:                                    `Do not promise a room or change dates until the system and staff have confirmed it.`,
	{field: "ssw.scenario", source: `Tamu ingin pindah karena suara bising, tetapi kamar pengganti berstatus belum diperiksa.`}:                                   `A guest wants to move because of noise, but the replacement room has not yet been inspected.`,
	{field: "ssw.response", source: `Minta maaf dan catat keluhan. Jangan berikan kunci kamar yang belum siap; minta senior dan housekeeping memeriksa pilihan.`}: `Apologize and record the complaint. Do not issue a key to a room that is not ready; ask a senior staff member and housekeeping to check the available options.`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `perubahan`}:                                                                                                                   `change`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `kamar kosong`}:                                                                                                                `vacant room`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `perpanjangan`}:                                                                                                                `extension`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `status kebersihan`}:                                                                                                           `cleaning status`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Apakah saya bisa pindah kamar?`}:                                                                                              `May I change rooms?`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Saya memeriksa ketersediaan dan kebersihannya.`}:                                                                              `I will check its availability and cleanliness.`,
	{field: "ssw.description", source: `Mendengar kebutuhan tamu, memberi panduan akurat, dan meneruskan masalah dengan tenang sesuai kewenangan.`}:               `Listen to guests' needs, provide accurate guidance, and calmly refer issues within your authority.`,
	{field: "ssw.title", source: `Memberi arah dan informasi fasilitas`}:                                                                                          `Giving Directions and Facility Information`,
	{field: "ssw.objective", source: `Memberi petunjuk singkat yang akurat dengan memakai informasi properti terbaru.`}:                                           `Give concise, accurate directions using the property's latest information.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Tamu menanyakan jam sarapan, lokasi lift, akses kamar, transportasi, dan layanan. Periksa papan informasi atau sumber properti yang terbaru. Gunakan arah sederhana dan peta bila ada. Jika belum tahu, tanyakan kepada rekan daripada menebak jadwal, lokasi, atau fasilitas.`}: `Guests may ask about breakfast hours, elevator locations, room access, transportation, or services. Check the latest property information or notices. Give simple directions and use a map if available. If you are unsure, ask a colleague instead of guessing a schedule, location, or facility.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Sebutkan lokasi serta patokan yang mudah, lalu tawarkan menunjukkan arah bila sesuai tugas. Untuk jadwal transportasi atau informasi di luar properti, gunakan sumber yang disetujui. Jangan mengandalkan jadwal kedaluwarsa atau membagikan data pribadi staf dan tamu.`}:       `Name the location and an easy landmark, and offer to show the way if that is part of your duties. Use approved sources for transportation schedules or information outside the property. Do not rely on outdated schedules or share staff or guest personal information.`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Tanyakan informasi yang dibutuhkan tamu`}:                                                                                           `Ask what information the guest needs`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Periksa papan, peta, atau sumber properti`}:                                                                                         `Check notices, maps, or property information`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Jelaskan lokasi atau jadwal dengan singkat`}:                                                                                        `Briefly explain the location or schedule`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Pastikan pemahaman dan eskalasi jika belum pasti`}:                                                                                  `Confirm understanding and refer the question if you are unsure`,
	{field: "ssw.caution", source: `Jangan memberi arah atau waktu yang belum diperiksa hanya agar cepat menjawab.`}:                                                 `Do not give unchecked directions or times just to answer quickly.`,
	{field: "ssw.scenario", source: `Tamu bertanya jadwal bus bandara, tetapi papan yang ada telah melewati tanggal berlaku.`}:                                       `A guest asks about the airport bus schedule, but the posted notice is past its validity date.`,
	{field: "ssw.response", source: `Jangan menebak jadwal. Katakan akan memeriksa informasi terbaru, lalu hubungi sumber transportasi atau petugas yang ditunjuk.`}: `Do not guess the schedule. Say that you will check the latest information, then contact the transportation provider or designated staff member.`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `panduan`}:                                                                                                                        `directions`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `di dalam gedung`}:                                                                                                                `inside the building`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `jadwal waktu`}:                                                                                                                   `schedule`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Di mana ruang sarapan?`}:                                                                                                         `Where is the breakfast room?`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Di sebelah lift.`}:                                                                                                               `It is next to the elevator.`,
	{field: "ssw.title", source: `Menerima keluhan dan mengatur tindak lanjut`}:                                                                                      `Receiving Complaints and Arranging Follow-Up`,
	{field: "ssw.objective", source: `Mendengarkan keluhan, meminta maaf atas ketidaknyamanan, mencatat fakta, dan meneruskan tindakan.`}:                            `Listen to complaints, apologize for the inconvenience, record the facts, and refer the matter for action.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Keluhan dapat menyangkut kebisingan, suhu, kebersihan, makanan, atau layanan. Dengarkan tanpa menyela, minta maaf atas ketidaknyamanan, dan ulangi masalah. Jangan menyalahkan rekan atau menjanjikan kompensasi maupun waktu perbaikan yang belum disetujui. Teruskan kepada bagian yang dapat bertindak.`}: `Complaints may concern noise, temperature, cleanliness, food, or service. Listen without interrupting, apologize for the inconvenience, and repeat the issue. Do not blame colleagues or promise compensation or repair times that have not been approved. Refer the matter to a department that can act.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Catat waktu, masalah yang dilaporkan, dan tindakan awal pada sistem yang aman. Untuk bahaya seperti bau gas, kabel panas, atau tamu sakit, gunakan jalur darurat properti. Setelah serah terima, jelaskan siapa yang menindaklanjuti dan kapan informasi akan diperbarui.`}:                                  `Record the time, reported issue, and initial action in a secure system. For hazards such as a gas smell, hot wiring, or an ill guest, use the property's emergency procedure. After handing the matter over, explain who will follow up and when the information will be updated.`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Dengarkan dan minta maaf dengan sopan`}:                                                                                                       `Listen and apologize politely`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Ulangi masalah serta catat fakta dan waktu`}:                                                                                                  `Repeat the issue and record the facts and time`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Hubungi bagian terkait sesuai tingkat risiko`}:                                                                                                `Contact the relevant department based on the level of risk`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Jelaskan tindak lanjut yang sudah dikonfirmasi dan cek status`}:                                                                               `Explain the confirmed follow-up and check its status`,
	{field: "ssw.caution", source: `Jangan menyalahkan tamu atau menjanjikan solusi yang belum disetujui.`}:                                                                    `Do not blame the guest or promise a solution that has not been approved.`,
	{field: "ssw.scenario", source: `Tamu mencium bau tajam di kamar dan merasa pusing; sumber bau belum diketahui.`}:                                                          `A guest smells a strong odor in the room and feels dizzy; the source of the odor is unknown.`,
	{field: "ssw.response", source: `Bantu tamu pindah ke tempat aman, segera laporkan kemungkinan bahaya, dan ikuti prosedur darurat; jangan menyuruhnya menunggu di kamar.`}: `Help the guest move to a safe place, immediately report the possible hazard, and follow emergency procedures; do not tell them to wait in the room.`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `keluhan`}:                                                                                                                                  `complaint`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `ketidaknyamanan`}:                                                                                                                          `inconvenience`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `bagian terkait`}:                                                                                                                           `relevant department`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `status penanganan`}:                                                                                                                        `handling status`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Mohon maaf atas ketidaknyamanan ini.`}:                                                                                                     `I am sorry for the inconvenience.`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Saya segera menghubungi petugas terkait.`}:                                                                                                 `I will contact the relevant staff member right away.`,
	{field: "ssw.title", source: `Permintaan khusus dan kebutuhan akses`}:                                                                                                      `Special Requests and Accessibility Needs`,
	{field: "ssw.objective", source: `Mengonfirmasi kebutuhan akses atau layanan khusus dan meneruskannya tanpa membuat janji yang belum pasti.`}:                              `Confirm accessibility or special service needs and refer them without making unverified promises.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Tamu mungkin meminta kamar aksesibel, bantuan barang, pilihan makanan, tempat tidur bayi, atau dukungan kesehatan. Tanyakan secukupnya dengan hormat dan jangan meminta detail pribadi yang tak diperlukan. Periksa fasilitas dan batas layanan properti. Permintaan terkait keselamatan atau kesehatan diteruskan kepada petugas terlatih.`}: `Guests may request an accessible room, help with belongings, food options, a baby cot, or health support. Ask only what is necessary and do so respectfully; do not request unnecessary personal details. Check the property's facilities and service limits. Refer safety or health-related requests to trained staff.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Catat kebutuhan dengan istilah yang disetujui tamu pada sistem aman. Ulangi hal yang dapat dilakukan dan yang masih menunggu konfirmasi. Jangan memberi saran medis atau menjanjikan fasilitas yang belum tersedia. Saat darurat, ikuti jalur bantuan properti.`}:                                                                             `Record the need in a secure system using terms the guest approves. Repeat what can be provided and what is still awaiting confirmation. Do not give medical advice or promise facilities that are unavailable. In an emergency, follow the property's assistance procedure.`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Tanyakan kebutuhan dengan sopan dan secukupnya`}:                                                                                                    `Ask politely and only as much as necessary about the need`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Periksa fasilitas serta layanan yang tersedia`}:                                                                                                     `Check available facilities and services`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Konfirmasi atau eskalasi kepada petugas tepat`}:                                                                                                     `Confirm with or refer the request to the appropriate staff member`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Catat permintaan secara aman dan pastikan serah terima`}:                                                                                            `Record the request securely and confirm the handover`,
	{field: "ssw.caution", source: `Jangan membuat asumsi tentang disabilitas atau kondisi kesehatan tamu.`}:                                                                         `Do not make assumptions about a guest's disability or health condition.`,
	{field: "ssw.scenario", source: `Tamu meminta kamar tanpa anak tangga, tetapi kamar yang tercatat tersedia belum dikonfirmasi kebersihannya.`}:                                   `A guest requests a step-free room, but the room listed as available has not been confirmed clean.`,
	{field: "ssw.response", source: `Jelaskan bahwa kamar sedang diperiksa, hubungi housekeeping atau senior untuk memastikan akses dan kesiapan, lalu beri pilihan terkonfirmasi.`}: `Explain that the room is being checked, contact housekeeping or a senior staff member to confirm accessibility and readiness, then offer a confirmed option.`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `permintaan khusus`}:                                                                                                                              `special request`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `anak tangga/perbedaan tinggi`}:                                                                                                                   `step/level difference`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `fasilitas`}:                                                                                                                                      `facility`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `akan memeriksa`}:                                                                                                                                 `will check`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Mohon kamar tanpa anak tangga.`}:                                                                                                                 `I would like a step-free room, please.`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Saya memeriksa kamar dan fasilitasnya.`}:                                                                                                         `I will check the room and its facilities.`,
	{field: "ssw.description", source: `Menyiapkan meja, mengonfirmasi pesanan makanan, dan menjaga kebersihan sesuai prosedur properti.`}:                                           `Prepare tables, confirm food orders, and maintain cleanliness according to property procedures.`,
	{field: "ssw.title", source: `Menyiapkan meja dan mengantar hidangan`}:                                                                                                           `Preparing Tables and Serving Dishes`,
	{field: "ssw.objective", source: `Mengikuti urutan pelayanan dan memastikan hidangan diserahkan kepada meja yang tepat.`}:                                                        `Follow the service sequence and make sure dishes are delivered to the correct table.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Layanan restoran dimulai dari kebersihan meja, penataan alat sesuai standar, dan konfirmasi jumlah tamu. Cocokkan pesanan dengan nomor meja atau kamar pada sistem. Bawa baki dengan aman, sebutkan hidangan bila perlu, dan jangan memindahkan makanan antar meja berdasarkan perkiraan.`}: `Restaurant service begins with clean tables, setting utensils to standard, and confirming the number of guests. Match orders to the table or room number in the system. Carry trays safely, name the dishes when needed, and never move food between tables based on a guess.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Periksa meja, alat makan, dan jalur berjalan. Ulangi pesanan penting kepada dapur. Jika label atau meja tidak jelas, berhenti di tempat aman dan konfirmasi. Tumpahan atau pecahan dilaporkan dan dibersihkan sesuai prosedur agar jalur tamu aman.`}:                                       `Check the table, utensils, and walking route. Repeat important orders to the kitchen. If a label or table is unclear, stop in a safe place and confirm. Report and clean spills or broken items according to procedure to keep guest routes safe.`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Periksa kebersihan meja dan perlengkapan`}:                                                                `Check that the table and equipment are clean`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Cocokkan pesanan dengan nomor meja/tamu`}:                                                                 `Match the order to the table or guest number`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Bawa dan sajikan melalui jalur aman`}:                                                                     `Carry and serve using a safe route`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Konfirmasi tiket tak jelas dan laporkan tumpahan`}:                                                        `Confirm unclear tickets and report spills`,
	{field: "ssw.caution", source: `Jangan membawa hidangan dengan label yang tidak cocok dengan pesanan.`}:                                `Do not carry a dish if its label does not match the order.`,
	{field: "ssw.scenario", source: `Dua meja memesan hidangan serupa, tetapi tiket dapur tidak mencantumkan nomor meja dengan jelas.`}:    `Two tables order similar dishes, but the kitchen ticket does not clearly show the table number.`,
	{field: "ssw.response", source: `Jangan menebak meja. Tahan hidangan di tempat aman dan konfirmasikan tiket dengan dapur atau rekan.`}: `Do not guess the table. Keep the dish in a safe place and confirm the ticket with the kitchen or a colleague.`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `penyajian makanan`}:                                                                                    `food service`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `peralatan makan`}:                                                                                      `tableware`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `tempat duduk/meja`}:                                                                                    `seat/table`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Saya mengonfirmasi pesanan.`}:                                                                          `I am confirming the order.`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Apakah ini hidangan yang Anda pesan?`}:                                                                 `Is this the dish you ordered?`,
	{field: "ssw.title", source: `Mengonfirmasi alergi dan pantangan makanan`}:                                                             `Confirming Allergies and Dietary Restrictions`,
	{field: "ssw.objective", source: `Meneruskan informasi alergi dengan tepat dan mencegah penyajian sebelum dapur mengonfirmasi.`}:       `Pass on allergy information accurately and prevent serving food until the kitchen confirms it.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Alergi makanan dapat menimbulkan reaksi berat. Dengarkan bahan yang disebut tamu dan catat dengan akurat. Jangan menyimpulkan hidangan aman karena bahan tidak tampak; bahan campuran dan kontak silang mungkin terjadi. Dapur atau penanggung jawab harus memeriksa resep dan cara penyiapan sesuai kebijakan properti.`}: `Food allergies can cause severe reactions. Listen to the ingredients named by the guest and record them accurately. Do not assume a dish is safe because an ingredient is not visible; mixed ingredients and cross-contact are possible. The kitchen or person in charge must check the recipe and preparation method according to property policy.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Teruskan permintaan langsung ke dapur melalui saluran kerja, lalu tunggu jawaban jelas. Bila keamanan tidak dapat dipastikan, jelaskan melalui petugas berwenang dan tawarkan pilihan yang sudah diverifikasi. Jangan menjanjikan “bebas” atau mengubah resep sendiri.`}:                                                   `Send the request directly to the kitchen through the proper work channel and wait for a clear answer. If safety cannot be confirmed, explain this through an authorized staff member and offer a verified alternative. Do not promise that a dish is “free of” an ingredient or change the recipe yourself.`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Dengarkan dan catat bahan yang harus dihindari`}:                                                                                                    `Listen and record the ingredients that must be avoided`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Tandai pesanan dan teruskan ke dapur`}:                                                                                                              `Flag the order and pass it to the kitchen`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Tunggu konfirmasi bahan serta kontak silang`}:                                                                                                       `Wait for confirmation about ingredients and cross-contact`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Sajikan hanya pilihan yang dinyatakan aman oleh petugas`}:                                                                                           `Serve only an option that staff have confirmed is safe`,
	{field: "ssw.caution", source: `Jangan menyatakan makanan aman sebelum bahan dan cara penyiapan diperiksa.`}:                                                                     `Do not say food is safe until its ingredients and preparation method have been checked.`,
	{field: "ssw.scenario", source: `Tamu alergi kacang meminta saus terpisah, tetapi label saus tidak memuat rincian bahan.`}:                                                       `A guest with a peanut allergy asks for sauce on the side, but the sauce label does not list its ingredients.`,
	{field: "ssw.response", source: `Jangan sajikan saus atau menjanjikan aman. Tandai pesanan, minta dapur memeriksa bahan dan kontak silang, lalu sampaikan hasil terkonfirmasi.`}: `Do not serve the sauce or promise that it is safe. Flag the order, ask the kitchen to check the ingredients and cross-contact, then communicate the confirmed result.`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `alergi`}:                                                                                                                                         `allergy`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `bahan baku`}:                                                                                                                                     `ingredient`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `disajikan terpisah`}:                                                                                                                             `served separately`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Saya memiliki alergi kacang.`}:                                                                                                                   `I have a peanut allergy.`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Mohon tunggu, saya akan mengonfirmasi ke dapur.`}:                                                                                                `Please wait while I confirm with the kitchen.`,
	{field: "ssw.title", source: `Kebersihan makanan dan peralatan`}:                                                                                                                 `Food and Equipment Hygiene`,
	{field: "ssw.objective", source: `Menjaga tangan, alat, dan area layanan serta menghentikan penyajian bila terjadi kontaminasi.`}:                                                `Keep hands, equipment, and service areas clean, and stop service if contamination occurs.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Tangan, peralatan, dan permukaan dapat memindahkan kotoran atau alergen. Ikuti waktu cuci tangan, penggunaan sarung tangan bila ditetapkan, serta pemisahan alat bersih dan bekas. Makanan yang jatuh, terkena cairan pembersih, atau tidak dijaga sesuai prosedur tidak disajikan begitu saja.`}: `Hands, equipment, and surfaces can transfer dirt or allergens. Follow handwashing schedules, use gloves when required, and keep clean equipment separate from used equipment. Do not serve food that has fallen, touched cleaning fluid, or was not kept according to procedure.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Cuci tangan dan ganti alat atau sarung tangan saat tugas berubah sesuai aturan. Jika ada pecahan kaca atau tumpahan, hentikan layanan area tersebut, jauhkan makanan, lalu minta pembersihan. Makanan yang jatuh tidak dikembalikan ke piring; catat dan minta pengganti aman.`}:                  `Wash your hands and change equipment or gloves when tasks change, as required. If there is broken glass or a spill, stop service in that area, move food away, and request cleanup. Never return dropped food to a plate; record the incident and request a safe replacement.`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Cuci tangan dan siapkan alat bersih`}:                                                                                                           `Wash your hands and prepare clean equipment`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Pisahkan makanan dari permukaan kotor`}:                                                                                                         `Keep food away from dirty surfaces`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Hentikan layanan dekat tumpahan atau pecahan`}:                                                                                                  `Stop service near spills or broken items`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Laporkan kontaminasi dan ikuti penggantian`}:                                                                                                    `Report contamination and follow replacement procedures`,
	{field: "ssw.caution", source: `Jangan menyajikan kembali makanan yang jatuh, terkena kotoran, atau tidak dijaga sesuai prosedur.`}:                                          `Do not serve food again if it has fallen, become dirty, or was not kept according to procedure.`,
	{field: "ssw.scenario", source: `Gelas pecah di dekat meja persiapan dan makanan terbuka berada di sebelahnya.`}:                                                             `A glass breaks near the preparation table, with uncovered food beside it.`,
	{field: "ssw.response", source: `Hentikan penyajian, jauhkan makanan dan orang dari pecahan, tandai area, lalu laporkan untuk pembersihan dan penggantian sesuai prosedur.`}: `Stop serving, move food and people away from the broken glass, mark the area, and report it for cleanup and replacement according to procedure.`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `kebersihan/higiene`}:                                                                                                                         `cleanliness/hygiene`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `cuci tangan`}:                                                                                                                                `handwashing`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `peralatan bersih`}:                                                                                                                           `clean equipment`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `kontaminasi`}:                                                                                                                                `contamination`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Gelas pecah.`}:                                                                                                                               `A glass is broken.`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Saya menjauhkan makanan dan segera melapor.`}:                                                                                                `I will move the food away and report it right away.`,
	{field: "ssw.description", source: `Menjaga status kamar dan barang temuan, memahami laporan keselamatan, serta membantu perencanaan dan serah terima layanan.`}:             `Maintain room status and found-property records, understand safety reports, and help with service planning and shift handovers.`,
	{field: "ssw.title", source: `Status kamar dan pelaporan kerusakan`}:                                                                                                         `Room Status and Damage Reporting`,
	{field: "ssw.objective", source: `Mencocokkan status kamar pada sistem serta melaporkan kerusakan sebelum kamar diberikan.`}:                                                 `Match the room status in the system and report damage before assigning the room.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Status kamar dapat berubah antara ditempati, perlu dibersihkan, sedang dibersihkan, diperiksa, dan siap. Gunakan istilah properti. Pemeriksaan mengikuti daftar tugas; staf hanya melakukan pekerjaan dalam kewenangannya. Kerusakan dicatat agar kamar tidak ditawarkan sebelum dinyatakan siap.`}: `A room may be occupied, need cleaning, be under cleaning, await inspection, or be ready. Use the property's terms. Follow the inspection checklist, and only perform work within your authority. Record damage so the room is not offered before it is declared ready.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Cocokkan nomor kamar dan status sistem, lalu ikuti urutan pemeriksaan. Jika ada kebocoran, kabel rusak, kaca pecah, atau barang tertinggal, jangan tandai siap. Beri tahu housekeeping atau teknisi dan perbarui sistem setelah pemeriksaan selesai.`}:                                              `Match the room number and system status, then follow the inspection sequence. If you find a leak, damaged wiring, broken glass, or a left-behind item, do not mark the room ready. Notify housekeeping or a technician and update the system after the inspection is complete.`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Cocokkan kamar dengan daftar dan status sistem`}:                                                                     `Match the room to the checklist and system status`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Periksa kebersihan serta fasilitas sesuai tugas`}:                                                                    `Check cleanliness and facilities as assigned`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Tandai dan laporkan kerusakan atau barang tertinggal`}:                                                               `Flag and report damage or left-behind items`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Perbarui status setelah pemeriksaan selesai`}:                                                                        `Update the status after the inspection is complete`,
	{field: "ssw.caution", source: `Jangan mengubah status menjadi siap hanya karena kamar tampak rapi atau menerima pesan lisan.`}:                   `Do not mark a room ready just because it looks tidy or someone told you it was ready.`,
	{field: "ssw.scenario", source: `Kamar tampak bersih, tetapi lampu kamar mandi berkedip dan sistem menyatakan menunggu pemeriksaan.`}:             `The room looks clean, but the bathroom light is flickering and the system says it is awaiting inspection.`,
	{field: "ssw.response", source: `Jangan ubah status menjadi siap. Laporkan lampu kepada teknisi/housekeeping dan tunggu konfirmasi pemeriksaan.`}: `Do not change the status to ready. Report the light to a technician or housekeeping and wait for inspection confirmation.`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `kamar tamu`}:                                                                                                      `guest room`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `sudah dibersihkan`}:                                                                                               `cleaned`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `pemeriksaan`}:                                                                                                     `inspection`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `kerusakan`}:                                                                                                       `damage`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Kamar ini masih diperiksa.`}:                                                                                      `This room is still being inspected.`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Saya memperbarui status setelah pemeriksaan.`}:                                                                    `I will update the status after the inspection.`,
	{field: "ssw.title", source: `Barang tertinggal dan keadaan darurat`}:                                                                             `Lost Property and Emergencies`,
	{field: "ssw.objective", source: `Mengamankan barang temuan atau bahaya serta segera memakai jalur laporan properti.`}:                            `Secure found items or hazards and promptly use the property's reporting channels.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Barang tertinggal dicatat beserta lokasi, waktu, dan deskripsi, lalu disimpan resmi; jangan membuka atau menggunakannya. Keadaan darurat dapat berupa kebakaran, gempa, kebocoran, kecelakaan, atau tamu sakit. Ikuti rencana evakuasi, laporkan kondisi, dan jangan menghalangi petugas darurat.`}: `Record the location, time, and description of a lost item, then store it through the official process; do not open or use it. Emergencies may include fires, earthquakes, leaks, accidents, or an ill guest. Follow the evacuation plan, report the situation, and do not obstruct emergency responders.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Jika melihat asap, bau gas, air mengalir deras, atau orang membutuhkan bantuan, utamakan keselamatan dan aktifkan prosedur alarm/panggilan. Barang mencurigakan tidak disentuh. Bantu arahkan orang ke tempat aman hanya dalam batas pelatihan Anda.`}:                                              `If you see smoke, smell gas, find a major water leak, or see someone needing help, put safety first and activate the alarm or call procedure. Do not touch suspicious items. Direct people to safety only within the limits of your training.`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Amati kondisi dan pastikan keselamatan`}:                                                                                     `Assess the situation and ensure safety`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Aktifkan pelaporan atau bantuan sesuai kejadian`}:                                                                            `Activate reporting or request help for the situation`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Jaga barang temuan tanpa membuka atau menggunakannya`}:                                                                       `Secure found property without opening or using it`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Catat lokasi dan serahkan kepada petugas berwenang`}:                                                                         `Record the location and hand it to authorized staff`,
	{field: "ssw.caution", source: `Jangan menyentuh barang mencurigakan atau menyelidiki bahaya yang belum aman.`}:                                           `Do not touch suspicious items or investigate a hazard before it is safe.`,
	{field: "ssw.scenario", source: `Asap keluar dari ruang servis dan tas tak dikenal berada dekat pintu.`}:                                                  `Smoke is coming from a service room, and an unknown bag is near the door.`,
	{field: "ssw.response", source: `Jangan masuk atau memindahkan tas. Jauhkan orang, aktifkan prosedur pelaporan, dan berikan lokasi asap kepada petugas.`}: `Do not enter or move the bag. Keep people away, activate the reporting procedure, and tell staff where the smoke is coming from.`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `barang tertinggal`}:                                                                                                       `lost property`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `penyimpanan`}:                                                                                                             `storage`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `kebakaran`}:                                                                                                               `fire`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `evakuasi`}:                                                                                                                `evacuation`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Saya melihat asap.`}:                                                                                                      `I see smoke.`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Saya mengarahkan ke tempat aman.`}:                                                                                        `I will guide people to a safe place.`,
	{field: "ssw.title", source: `Informasi promosi dan serah terima shift`}:                                                                                  `Promotional Information and Shift Handover`,
	{field: "ssw.objective", source: `Menyampaikan penawaran yang disahkan dan menyerahkan pekerjaan terbuka dengan waktu serta status yang jelas.`}:          `Share approved offers and hand over open work with clear timing and status.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Perencanaan dan publikasi dapat meliputi fasilitas, acara, paket, atau layanan sekitar. Gunakan materi yang disetujui karena tanggal, harga, dan syarat berubah. Saat shift berganti, teruskan keluhan, status kamar, permintaan, waktu, pihak yang dihubungi, dan langkah berikutnya. Jangan mengandalkan ingatan atau status lama.`}: `Planning and communications may cover facilities, events, packages, or nearby services. Use approved materials because dates, prices, and terms change. At shift change, pass on complaints, room status, requests, times, contacts, and next steps. Do not rely on memory or outdated status information.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Sebelum menjawab tentang promosi, cek materi resmi atau petugas penanggung jawab. Saat handover, catat kamar/pesanan terkait, fakta, tindakan, status, dan tindak lanjut. Serahkan langsung serta minta penerima mengulang informasi penting.`}:                                                                                        `Before answering questions about a promotion, check the official materials or ask the person in charge. For a handover, record the relevant room or order, facts, actions, status, and follow-up. Hand it over directly and ask the recipient to repeat important information.`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Periksa materi resmi dan masa berlakunya`}:                                                                                     `Check the official materials and their validity period`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Jelaskan penawaran yang telah disahkan`}:                                                                                       `Explain offers that have been approved`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Catat permintaan dan pekerjaan terbuka`}:                                                                                       `Record requests and outstanding work`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Serahkan langsung dan pastikan penerima memahami`}:                                                                             `Hand over directly and make sure the recipient understands`,
	{field: "ssw.caution", source: `Jangan menjanjikan harga, fasilitas, atau status kamar yang belum disahkan.`}:                                               `Do not promise an unapproved price, facility, or room status.`,
	{field: "ssw.scenario", source: `Tamu menanyakan harga promosi pada poster lama, sedangkan sistem menyebut periode telah berakhir.`}:                        `A guest asks about a promotion price on an old poster, but the system shows that the offer period has ended.`,
	{field: "ssw.response", source: `Jangan menjanjikan harga dari poster lama. Periksa dengan penanggung jawab dan jelaskan bahwa harga sedang dikonfirmasi.`}: `Do not promise the price shown on the old poster. Check with the person in charge and explain that the price is being confirmed.`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `perencanaan`}:                                                                                                               `planning`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `publikasi/informasi`}:                                                                                                       `publication/information`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `masa berlaku`}:                                                                                                              `validity period`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Apakah paket ini masih berlaku?`}:                                                                                           `Is this package still valid?`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Saya akan memeriksa informasi terbaru.`}:                                                                                    `I will check the latest information.`,
}
